Data files

   src/atdev_serve/data/token_order.npy -- a permutation of the Qwen3.8-27B vocabulary ids ordered by
   token frequency in responses generated by Qwen3.8-27B to prompts from HuggingFaceH4/ultrachat_200k
   (train_sft, MIT License) and openai/gsm8k (train, MIT License) only; contains no text. Rebuild it with
   tools/build_draft_vocab.py.
   bench/gsm8k_test.jsonl -- openai/gsm8k test split (MIT License, Copyright (c) 2021 OpenAI).

